    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“审美”和“品味”是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人说审美是未来的“顶级竞争力”</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人说审美需要吃过穿过用过“好东西”</span></p><span></span><p><span>也有人说审美是天生的，模仿不来也修炼不来</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客我们来聊聊“审美”和“品味”，以及我在“审美养成”这条路上都做了什么...</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">00:02:05</a> &nbsp;“审美”“品味”是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">00:03:58</a> &nbsp;品味可以靠模仿吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">00:07:35</a> &nbsp;好品味是天生的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">00:15:20</a> &nbsp;不靠钱，也能有“好审美”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">00:05:03</a> &nbsp;养成好审美，或许可以从这个小习惯开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">00:06:26</a> &nbsp;好审美是需要经营的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">00:10:10</a> &nbsp;流行易变，要如何形成自己的风格？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留下你的想法和故事，更多审美和家居分享，欢迎关注我的小红书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待能和听友们来回切磋，共同成长！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjTGaaRnC0dnWXM332JlnTeVOq1o.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
