    <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 10:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不知道大家是不是也有“决策困难”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>平时很有独立思考能力和主见</span></p><span></span><p><span>但一旦遇到重大决定或者觉得自己站在人生十字路口的时候</span></p><span></span><p><span>就会非常纠结</span></p><span></span><p><span>“我应该选这条路更好呢还是另一条其实也不错？”“我如果选错了怎么办？”...</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听本期《米友时间》，一起</span><strong><span>拆解“决策瘫痪”的深层原因</span></strong><span>，找到属于你的“</span><strong><span>无痛决策方法论</span></strong><span>”！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">00:01:48</a> 下决定时容易纠结反而是好事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">00:02:36</a> 去哪座城市发展？真的是永恒的纠结话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">00:04:00</a> 真的有“最优”的决定吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">00:06:00</a> 人生是旅程，经历的都是风景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">00:07:15</a> &nbsp;米总是怎么“做决定”从香港搬到上海...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">00:09:45</a> &nbsp;被合作伙伴背叛，收入清0后，毅然决然做下的”职场转向决策“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">00:13:45</a> &nbsp;怎么破除下决定后的反刍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">00:17:35</a> 决策时，到底什么才是真的要纳入考虑的“沉没成本”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">00:18:40</a> 没有错的决定，不决定才是最错的决定</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留下你的想法和故事，我们会抽选1位的忠实听众，送出Joyce Beauty【买手臻选护肤礼包】。</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待能和听友们来回切磋，共同成长！</span></p>]]></description>
