    <title>Vol.12 | 幸福婚姻有秘诀？建议听完再考虑结婚！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/682b0a14457b22ce0d74b18b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">682b0a14457b22ce0d74b18b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 May 2025 10:39:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在这个浪漫的节日，想和大家聊聊“爱情与婚姻”</span></p><span></span><p><span>米总和她的英国老公，相识20年，结婚18年</span></p><span></span><p><span>“跨国婚姻”“姐弟恋”“女强男弱”这些标签伴随着他们的恋爱与婚姻</span></p><span></span><p><span>两个不尽相同的个体如何找到契合的相处模式？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“结婚”这个决定要怎么下才不后悔？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“幸福婚姻”的经营有哪些秘诀？</span></p><span></span><p><span>婚姻是爱情的延续，还是妥协的艺术？</span></p><span></span><p><span>......</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听本期《米友时间》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpb1OmmjMiVYu9TdmDTnrPyS5v6D.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">00:01:04</a> 米总感情状况大公开</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">00:01:49</a> 在酒吧找老公？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">00:06:28</a> 三个人的“故事” ，是谁没有了姓名...</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">00:09:00</a> “爱”真的是本能吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">00:11:47</a> “姐弟恋”中跨不去的坎</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">00:12:06</a> 温馨提示：结婚前尽可能多地去恋爱！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">00:14:06</a> 米总想分手&amp;老公大升温?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">00:17:08</a> “我在QQ上把他甩了”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1181">00:19:41</a> 现男友vs前男友，真的很难选...</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">00:22:08</a> 米总真情流露：老公最难能可贵的是...</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">00:25:44</a> 突然就结婚了？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1614">00:26:54</a> “PUA”英国婆婆只需要学会...</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">00:29:22</a> 结婚还得看风水？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">00:31:50</a> 婚姻是过出来的，不是幻想出来的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2028">00:33:48</a> 婚姻中不可避免的问题</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2181">00:36:21</a> 44岁生娃是为了自己“不后悔”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">00:40:34</a> 跨国婚姻中的“教育理念”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">00:45:18</a> 请记得教你的孩子“打架”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2876">00:47:56</a> 婚姻就是一场大型的妥协</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区留下你的想法和故事，我们会抽选</span><strong><span>1位</span></strong><span>的忠实听众，送出Joyce Beauty</span><strong><span>【</span></strong><span>520浪漫护肤礼包</span><strong><span>】</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有任何感兴趣话题，也可以在评论区留言给米总。</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待能和听友们来回切磋，共同成长！</span></p>]]></description>
