    <guid isPermaLink="false">680227ca1f1db84a562031b5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Apr 2025 11:01:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>似乎每个“独立女性”在成长中，或多或少都面临着“底层自信”这个课题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“不自信”的根源是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“底层自信”是天生的还是Fake it till u make it?</span></p><span></span><p><span>“自信“之后一切就会自动好起来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>...</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客，我们邀请到了办公室另外两位，别人眼中理想的职场女精英，旁人眼中「自信从容」「个性飞扬」「松弛有度」的她们，内心真的“自信”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾介绍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>-Shirley，Joyce Beauty 品牌顾问</span></p><span></span><p><span>-莎莎，Joyce Beauty财务总监</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Show Notes |</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">00:01:14</a> 办公室大拷问：是“自信”还是“社交面具”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">00:05:17</a> 米总是如何成为米总的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">00:07:01</a> 构建 “自信”的底层逻辑是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">00:12:47</a> 怎么屏蔽外界的声音？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">00:11:57</a> 解决“不自信”的方法论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">00:17:09</a> &nbsp;原生家庭造成的“不自信”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">00:20:35</a> “自信”会随着年龄浮动吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1313">00:21:53</a> 米总至今会梦到的“至暗时刻”首次公开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1411">00:23:31</a> &nbsp;自信地去“搞砸”一些事吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">00:27:40</a> &nbsp;如何挖掘优势，构建“自信支点”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">00:32:32</a> &nbsp;构建“底层自信”方法论总结</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>把决定权交给大家，下一期你想听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 怎么找到”人生职业“？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 不做医美，如何高质量抗衰？</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 如何成为“高精力高能量”的人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎投票~</span></p><span></span><p><span>采用后，我们会随机抽选忠实听众，送出Joyce Beauty的专属福利噢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>有任何问题或感兴趣话题，也可以在评论区留言给米总。期待能和听友们来回切磋，共同成长！</span></p>]]></description>
